  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "RenderTexture is a specialized class extending Texture, designed to function as a rendering target for cameras. It implements a ping-pong buffering mechanism using two internal RenderTarget instances to prevent rendering feedback loops. Its primary role is to manage the double buffering state via readIndex and written flags, providing a mechanism for materials to read the most recently completed render output."
  },
